  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "碩士論文",
    "sub_ename": "MASTER THESIS",
    "describe_ch": "完成碩士論文。課程內容包含論文題目的擬定、相關文獻蒐集與閱讀的引導、研究方法的選擇、研究結果的呈現與論文寫作…等各方面的引導與諮詢。強調訓練學生的邏輯思考能力、時間管理、研究執行力、學術寫作與國內外發表學術論文的能力。",
    "describe_eh": "The purpose of this course is to help graduate students complete their thesis writing and fulfill the requirement for Master of Arts degree at Feng Chia University. In addition to the specialized methodological knowledge in the main field of study, graduate students will demonstrate professional expertise and understanding in both broad knowledge of the field and a considerable degree of specialized knowledge in certain areas of the field as well as insight into current research and development study. This course will also focus on students’ abilities to integrate knowledge with the training in critical thinking, time management, conducting research, and academic writing in a national and international research and development context.",
